    <p>Braun's BNA100US is a battery-operated electric aspirator. Per the manufacturer's specs: 2 suction levels, 2 nose tip sizes, dishwasher-safe tips and collection cup (top rack only), suitable from birth, and FSA/HSA eligible. We have not tested this model, so we have no cleaning-time or sound data for it. It is the only electric on our shortlist whose manufacturer explicitly says "suitable from birth" — but that is a claim, not a measurement.</p>
